WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.100 --> 01:37.993
=Episode 20=

01:44.080 --> 01:44.761
Come and see.

02:05.800 --> 02:06.720
I didn't want to disturb you,

02:08.281 --> 02:09.521
so I came without announcing.

02:28.760 --> 02:29.521
I'm Zhao Ling.

02:30.281 --> 02:31.401
Greetings, ladies.

02:32.640 --> 02:34.081
So you're Commander Zhao.

02:34.200 --> 02:35.681
Truly a man of striking presence

02:35.681 --> 02:36.841
and extraordinary bearing.

02:36.841 --> 02:38.281
Have you been waiting all night?

02:39.401 --> 02:41.521
You must be exhausted.

02:41.521 --> 02:42.521
Indeed.

03:01.121 --> 03:02.241
These two young lovebirds,

03:02.480 --> 03:03.760
have they had a falling out?

03:27.515 --> 03:31.549
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

03:34.114 --> 03:38.948
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

03:42.276 --> 03:49.143
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye
will fill my eyes with tears♪

03:50.302 --> 03:57.028
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

03:57.358 --> 04:00.318
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

04:00.361 --> 04:01.361
I see.

04:01.480 --> 04:04.001
So it's not that Commander Zhao
doesn't understand Miss Xie.

04:04.001 --> 04:06.760
It's Miss Xie who's been giving him
the cold shoulder.

04:08.281 --> 04:09.361
No wonder.

04:09.361 --> 04:10.841
It seems their feelings

04:11.160 --> 04:13.361
are as strong as those between

04:13.361 --> 04:14.521
Young Madam and Young Lord Yu.

04:14.521 --> 04:15.720
Indeed.

04:16.760 --> 04:18.681
If a young lady makes a good match,

04:18.840 --> 04:20.721
she'll be welcomed everywhere she goes

04:21.161 --> 04:22.561
and treated with respect.

04:23.681 --> 04:26.001
But without her three entries
in the county records,

04:26.601 --> 04:28.561
how could she have found
such a fine match?

04:32.760 --> 04:33.760
Today,

04:33.840 --> 04:35.960
we truly witnessed quite a spectacle.

04:36.041 --> 04:37.440
Thank you for your hospitality.

04:37.440 --> 04:39.001
I'll take my leave now.

04:40.161 --> 04:41.080
Please wait.

04:41.840 --> 04:43.200
We shouldn't have to

04:43.200 --> 04:44.200
hold back with each other.

04:44.721 --> 04:46.121
Please don't fault me for being forward.

04:49.801 --> 04:51.080
Just now, the Old Madam

04:51.080 --> 04:52.121
came to me specifically

04:52.681 --> 04:54.640
to inquire about Miss Wu.

04:55.561 --> 04:57.041
Between the lines,

04:57.801 --> 05:00.001
it sounded like she planned
to bring her into Lord Wei's household.

05:00.561 --> 05:02.161
Given our friendship,

05:02.520 --> 05:04.200
I rushed over to give you the news.

05:04.801 --> 05:06.561
You'd better prepare yourself
as soon as possible.

05:09.121 --> 05:11.400
I had thought that you,
so noble and honored,

05:11.880 --> 05:13.241
with such a solid family foundation,

05:13.721 --> 05:14.681
would surely

05:14.801 --> 05:16.361
have a smooth and contented life
in the Wei family.

05:17.640 --> 05:19.400
I see now that I was too naive.

05:20.601 --> 05:22.640
Every family has its troubles.

05:27.200 --> 05:28.121
Yake,

05:28.601 --> 05:29.721
all these years,

05:30.080 --> 05:32.481
our family came from Yongning Prefecture
to the capital.

05:33.200 --> 05:34.361
Step by step.

05:34.840 --> 05:36.200
In the end, whether it was the woman
relying on the man

05:36.200 --> 05:37.361
or the man relying on the woman,

05:39.121 --> 05:40.721
others may not know,

05:41.440 --> 05:42.921
but someone as perceptive as you

05:43.241 --> 05:45.241
surely understands.

05:49.400 --> 05:50.640
You're right.

05:50.640 --> 05:51.880
Please get some rest

05:51.880 --> 05:52.921
when you get home.

06:07.960 --> 06:09.121
Miss Xie?

06:09.121 --> 06:09.840
She can't take her on.

06:10.840 --> 06:12.481
Her mother-in-law?
She wouldn't dare cross.

06:13.121 --> 06:14.440
Bottling up all that anger,

06:14.840 --> 06:16.361
she took it out on me.

06:16.801 --> 06:18.361
She even tried to hit me where it hurts.

06:19.041 --> 06:21.080
She thinks she can push me around.

06:22.041 --> 06:22.921
Right?

06:25.721 --> 06:26.561
Let's go home.

06:30.803 --> 06:32.983
(Virtue Blesses the Hometown)

06:43.001 --> 06:44.280
Still upset?

06:45.520 --> 06:46.481
Mr. Zhao.

06:49.760 --> 06:51.481
Do you look down on me?

07:10.880 --> 07:12.840
I don't look down on you.

07:13.801 --> 07:14.400
It's just that...

07:14.400 --> 07:15.640
Returning to the capital to investigate,

07:16.200 --> 07:17.440
going into danger alone,

07:20.241 --> 07:21.440
and getting hurt.

07:24.400 --> 07:25.921
You told me none of it.

07:26.721 --> 07:28.200
Do you think I am

07:32.080 --> 07:33.320
completely useless?

07:34.681 --> 07:36.001
The capital's court

07:36.760 --> 07:38.481
is a deadly game,

07:38.840 --> 07:40.320
where one wrong move
could cost you your life.

07:42.001 --> 07:43.121
My duty is not yet done.

07:44.041 --> 07:45.840
I feared dragging you into it.

07:49.161 --> 07:50.121
But I also know

07:50.121 --> 07:51.161
I can't hide this from you.

07:51.681 --> 07:53.161
You would still worry about me.

07:53.960 --> 07:55.801
I just wanted to protect you
a little more.

07:56.200 --> 07:58.400
But I'm not a little girl anymore.

08:00.121 --> 08:01.601
I am strong enough now.

08:01.880 --> 08:03.640
Strong enough to share your burdens.

08:05.561 --> 08:07.041
Whatever you do,

08:07.440 --> 08:08.760
whatever you plan,

08:09.161 --> 08:11.001
you should tell me first.

08:24.481 --> 08:25.520
Understood.

08:27.681 --> 08:29.200
I was wrong this time.

08:34.001 --> 08:35.441
The court is a battlefield.

08:35.961 --> 08:37.321
You must grip the sword

08:39.121 --> 08:40.520
and hold onto power.

08:42.520 --> 08:43.800
Only by standing higher

08:43.800 --> 08:45.040
can I keep you safe

08:48.481 --> 08:50.400
and ensure that no one in this world

08:51.920 --> 08:53.441
dares to wrong you.

08:53.880 --> 08:55.160
But all I want

08:58.001 --> 08:59.601
is to stay by your side

09:01.241 --> 09:02.800
and never be apart from you again.

09:11.361 --> 09:12.121
Where is Sen?

09:13.160 --> 09:14.081
How is he?

09:15.560 --> 09:16.441
Sen.

09:40.040 --> 09:40.841
Sen.

09:41.201 --> 09:43.040
You can't keep going on like this

09:43.280 --> 09:44.760
with Mr. Zhao.

09:56.081 --> 09:56.640
Forget it.

09:58.160 --> 10:00.361
In this world, loyalty and duty
rarely find their balance.

10:01.160 --> 10:02.441
If one day

10:03.441 --> 10:04.361
he could understand

10:04.361 --> 10:06.121
every choice I made at every turn,

10:08.160 --> 10:09.520
I would not be pleased,

10:11.441 --> 10:12.640
because that would mean

10:14.241 --> 10:15.961
he had walked the same road as I have

10:18.520 --> 10:20.321
and faced the same hardships.

10:21.880 --> 10:22.841
Let him be.

10:24.321 --> 10:25.481
Like a tree putting out shoots

10:26.001 --> 10:27.040
or grass bearing flowers,

10:30.400 --> 10:32.081
each has its own way of living.

10:43.717 --> 10:45.770
(Yu Residence)

10:51.920 --> 10:52.721
Young Madam.

10:52.841 --> 10:53.560
The Young Master

10:53.560 --> 10:55.121
still has you on his mind.

10:57.961 --> 10:59.280
But he remembered wrong.

10:59.920 --> 11:01.601
These sesame flatbreads
are covered in spices.

11:02.760 --> 11:04.081
I have never been able to eat them.

11:05.481 --> 11:07.280
Ever since he went to Ganlin Town,

11:08.400 --> 11:09.841
he seems to have become
a different person.

11:11.001 --> 11:12.680
Yet somehow, we've grown apart.

11:15.880 --> 11:17.481
Why is that?

11:18.760 --> 11:19.721
Tell me,

11:20.760 --> 11:22.280
do all married couples

11:23.560 --> 11:25.400
end up like this with time?

11:27.760 --> 11:29.121
As the days go by,

11:31.241 --> 11:32.520
they grow cold.

11:35.520 --> 11:36.400
Young Madam.

11:37.961 --> 11:39.241
Madam has sent word.

11:39.560 --> 11:41.441
The celebration gifts
for Young Master Ji's first birthday

11:41.441 --> 11:43.441
need to be inventoried.

11:43.680 --> 11:44.800
Along with the gift list,

11:44.800 --> 11:46.241
they are all to be entered
into the household accounts.

11:50.040 --> 11:50.961
Ms. Shu.

11:51.441 --> 11:53.001
Wasn't it agreed before

11:53.121 --> 11:54.241
that this banquet

11:54.241 --> 11:55.441
would be mine to arrange?

11:55.920 --> 11:57.321
And the celebration gifts

11:57.800 --> 11:59.201
would belong to
the first branch of the family?

11:59.680 --> 12:01.520
Madam only changed her mind

12:01.520 --> 12:02.560
after the banquet was over.

12:03.201 --> 12:04.001
If

12:04.001 --> 12:05.721
you have any questions,

12:05.800 --> 12:07.481
I suggest you ask her directly.

12:08.760 --> 12:10.520
It doesn't matter
whose account they're on.

12:11.280 --> 12:13.160
It's all for Ji's honor.

12:14.121 --> 12:15.481
I'll have Mozhan

12:15.841 --> 12:17.361
count them and send them over.

12:17.841 --> 12:18.481
Yes.

12:18.841 --> 12:19.601
Young Madam.

12:20.241 --> 12:21.280
I take my leave.

12:43.241 --> 12:44.081
Master.

12:46.081 --> 12:48.640
What kind of man is this Zhao Ling?

12:48.841 --> 12:49.721
Five years ago,

12:50.321 --> 12:51.800
he wasn't even a commoner.

12:53.001 --> 12:54.361
A mere nobody.

12:54.680 --> 12:56.040
He caught some luck.

12:56.800 --> 12:58.241
And with help from the Ninth Young Lady,

12:58.601 --> 12:59.961
his fate was changed.

13:00.321 --> 13:02.040
You have read many books.

13:04.241 --> 13:06.280
But you still haven't learned
to read people.

13:11.680 --> 13:12.880
Zhao Ling,

13:12.961 --> 13:14.081
five years ago,

13:14.361 --> 13:15.640
relied on raw courage.

13:15.800 --> 13:17.081
A reckless brute.

13:17.201 --> 13:19.040
He won the Emperor's favor

13:19.680 --> 13:21.721
by daring to fight and risk everything.

13:22.481 --> 13:23.520
Five years on,

13:23.961 --> 13:25.441
he relies on ambition.

13:25.721 --> 13:28.040
Judging by how he operates
in the capital,

13:28.241 --> 13:29.441
he's grown

13:29.520 --> 13:30.841
harder

13:30.841 --> 13:31.920
and more ruthless.

13:32.841 --> 13:34.160
But I wonder

13:34.560 --> 13:36.800
why he keeps attacking our family
so relentlessly?

13:43.680 --> 13:44.481
I have been unfilial.

13:45.721 --> 13:46.601
There is something

13:47.920 --> 13:49.560
I have hidden from you and Mother.

13:52.880 --> 13:53.961
Back in Huaying,

13:54.721 --> 13:56.560
I was the one who instructed Zuo

13:57.481 --> 13:58.640
and her brother

13:58.650 --> 13:59.476
(Framing Fu for lost virtue)

13:59.920 --> 14:01.121
to slander the Ninth Young Lady.

14:05.441 --> 14:06.560
What about the written confession?

14:07.121 --> 14:08.560
It was burned in Ganlin.

14:13.081 --> 14:14.441
At the first-year banquet,

14:14.601 --> 14:16.241
I crossed words with her.

14:16.721 --> 14:17.721
Even then, I felt

14:17.721 --> 14:19.361
there was something off in her gaze.

14:19.800 --> 14:21.560
I have been shrewd all my life,

14:21.800 --> 14:23.001
but because of you,

14:23.280 --> 14:25.241
I showed my unease in front of her.

14:29.081 --> 14:30.800
Since it's come to this,

14:31.560 --> 14:33.201
from now on, our two families

14:34.160 --> 14:36.040
will fight until one of us falls.

14:38.520 --> 14:40.721
Since it's already a fight to the death,

14:40.721 --> 14:42.721
then there is room to maneuver.

14:44.920 --> 14:46.241
A wildfire, if smothered,

14:46.361 --> 14:47.601
is but a spark.

14:48.160 --> 14:49.560
But if you let it spread,

14:50.640 --> 14:52.520
it will burn the sky.

14:58.961 --> 15:00.400
Your Majesty, please hear this.

15:01.040 --> 15:02.241
The treasury has been depleted

15:02.321 --> 15:03.361
for some time now.

15:04.040 --> 15:05.601
The corruption
in the salt administration

15:05.601 --> 15:07.001
is deeply troubling.

15:07.481 --> 15:08.680
Arresting corrupt officials

15:08.680 --> 15:09.760
and clearing the salt routes

15:10.001 --> 15:11.721
is only boiling water
to stop it from steaming.

15:11.721 --> 15:13.160
It treats the symptoms, not the root.

15:13.481 --> 15:14.481
In my view,

15:14.880 --> 15:16.081
to truly uproot

15:16.400 --> 15:17.920
the long-standing ills
of the salt administration,

15:18.400 --> 15:19.520
the urgent task

15:20.640 --> 15:22.800
is to reform the salt laws.

15:27.001 --> 15:27.841
I propose

15:28.400 --> 15:29.361
that the salt laws

15:30.121 --> 15:32.081
be changed from exchange
to silver payment.

15:32.321 --> 15:34.520
The old system of salt merchants
delivering grain to the border

15:34.520 --> 15:36.241
in exchange for salt permits

15:36.241 --> 15:37.800
should be replaced
with direct silver payments.

15:37.880 --> 15:39.121
This will simplify procedures,

15:39.241 --> 15:40.481
lower costs,

15:40.560 --> 15:43.121
and reduce opportunities for corruption.

15:47.745 --> 15:50.300
(Qianqing Palace)

15:51.961 --> 15:53.001
Grand Secretary Tian.

15:53.601 --> 15:55.680
The salt laws left by our forebears

15:55.800 --> 15:57.721
are the very foundation of the state.

15:58.040 --> 15:59.400
Military pay across the realm,

15:59.400 --> 16:00.640
the lifeline of the salt merchants,

16:00.800 --> 16:02.721
all depend on this system.

16:02.880 --> 16:04.640
How could we tamper with it so casually?

16:06.160 --> 16:07.040
Reasonable.

16:07.920 --> 16:08.880
Salt administration

16:09.121 --> 16:10.441
affects the nation's foundation.

16:11.560 --> 16:13.361
It must be considered carefully.

16:14.400 --> 16:15.081
Grand Secretary.

16:15.560 --> 16:16.481
In the time of the founding emperor,

16:16.841 --> 16:18.760
the salt tax could support
a million troops.

16:19.441 --> 16:20.441
Now,

16:20.560 --> 16:22.520
it cannot even feed
three hundred thousand border soldiers.

16:22.880 --> 16:24.601
Clearly, reforming the salt laws

16:24.760 --> 16:26.841
is imperative.

16:29.160 --> 16:31.081
With the border under pressure,

16:31.920 --> 16:32.920
though the salt administration

16:32.920 --> 16:34.241
has established rules,

16:34.760 --> 16:37.040
we must adapt when change is needed.

16:37.680 --> 16:38.400
Grand Secretary Tian.

16:38.400 --> 16:39.400
This thunderbolt out of the blue...

16:39.400 --> 16:41.121
Surely you knew nothing of it?

16:41.560 --> 16:43.081
Whoever shoulders this matter

16:43.081 --> 16:45.160
will become the enemy of every official
at court.

16:46.160 --> 16:47.201
I

16:47.201 --> 16:48.481
didn't hear

16:48.481 --> 16:49.601
a thing about it.

16:49.601 --> 16:50.321
Gentlemen,

16:50.321 --> 16:51.601
go ask him

16:51.601 --> 16:52.560
yourselves.

16:53.721 --> 16:54.481
Grand Secretary Tian.

16:54.481 --> 16:55.081
Grand Secretary.

16:57.001 --> 16:57.920
He's

16:58.560 --> 17:00.081
like a weather vane.

17:01.241 --> 17:02.201
How did someone like him

17:02.201 --> 17:03.601
ever get into the Grand Secretariat?

17:03.721 --> 17:05.441
How he got in doesn't matter.

17:05.441 --> 17:06.560
The fact that he survived in there

17:06.560 --> 17:07.800
is a skill in itself.

17:08.520 --> 17:09.441
He clearly

17:09.721 --> 17:11.520
doesn't want to get involved
in this matter.

17:11.800 --> 17:13.360
This is no simple affair.

17:16.961 --> 17:17.681
Greetings,

17:18.360 --> 17:19.360
Your Majesty.

17:21.320 --> 17:22.120
Rise.

17:28.360 --> 17:29.201
You saw all that?

17:29.681 --> 17:31.040
A whole room full of people,

17:31.641 --> 17:33.040
each with their own calculations.

17:33.520 --> 17:34.961
I will ask you just one thing.

17:35.201 --> 17:36.721
Can this salt reform

17:36.721 --> 17:37.401
go through?

17:41.481 --> 17:42.600
In the military,

17:43.401 --> 17:44.840
I often deal with provisions and pay.

17:45.641 --> 17:47.161
I also have some knowledge
of the salt laws.

17:47.520 --> 17:48.401
In my view,

17:49.401 --> 17:50.441
the salt administration

17:50.961 --> 17:52.320
is rotten to the bone.

17:52.840 --> 17:54.120
Cutting out the rot
and scraping the bone

17:54.721 --> 17:55.520
will be painful.

17:56.161 --> 17:57.840
But if we let it fester,

17:59.241 --> 18:00.401
we risk losing the hearts

18:01.441 --> 18:02.840
of the soldiers on the border garrisons.

18:05.441 --> 18:07.001
Well spoken.

18:08.360 --> 18:11.401
Some in the court
call Grand Secretary Yu reckless.

18:11.800 --> 18:14.800
Others weep that the ancestral laws
must not change.

18:15.280 --> 18:17.161
But have any of them
ever been to the border?

18:18.441 --> 18:18.961
I

18:19.681 --> 18:21.320
trust you.

18:22.721 --> 18:23.560
Then I

18:24.760 --> 18:26.080
volunteer to take charge

18:27.961 --> 18:29.161
of overseeing the salt administration.

18:29.241 --> 18:29.760
Good.

18:30.721 --> 18:32.721
I appoint you
as an Assistant Censor-in-Chief.

18:33.040 --> 18:33.961
Audit the accounts.

18:34.241 --> 18:35.080
Arrest the offenders.

18:35.320 --> 18:36.840
Execute first, and report later.

18:37.161 --> 18:38.481
I do not care about the process.

18:38.881 --> 18:40.161
I only want the result.

18:42.120 --> 18:43.080
A year from now,

18:43.641 --> 18:45.001
the granaries
along the nine border garrisons

18:45.080 --> 18:46.161
will surely be filled

18:46.161 --> 18:47.520
with salt and grain.

18:56.080 --> 18:57.040
I accept the decree.

19:04.241 --> 19:06.080
I am willing to be Your Majesty's blade
to cut out the rot.

19:07.401 --> 19:08.760
The day the salt administration
is cleansed

19:09.520 --> 19:11.360
will be the day I return to report.

19:42.441 --> 19:43.481
You took it?

19:44.040 --> 19:44.681
I did.

19:47.961 --> 19:48.760
The Anzhou merchants,

19:48.881 --> 19:49.721
the Yan merchants,

19:50.040 --> 19:51.161
one south, one north,

19:51.721 --> 19:52.921
are all fighting for their livelihoods.

19:53.241 --> 19:54.881
They'll fight to the bitter end.

19:55.201 --> 19:56.560
And Yuanbao

19:56.560 --> 19:57.681
is caught up in it too.

19:58.481 --> 19:59.800
But that is only the first concern.

20:00.641 --> 20:01.280
Since ancient times,

20:01.280 --> 20:02.441
officials and merchants have colluded.

20:02.760 --> 20:05.040
Every merchant guild
has powerful backers.

20:05.401 --> 20:06.760
When you strike with this blade,

20:07.001 --> 20:08.241
who knows who you'll hit.

20:08.560 --> 20:09.401
That is the second.

20:10.161 --> 20:11.001
Third,

20:11.800 --> 20:13.441
the border towns
rely on the grain-for-salt system

20:13.520 --> 20:14.681
to supply their troops.

20:15.080 --> 20:16.481
If we switch to silver payments,

20:16.721 --> 20:17.161
the...

20:18.201 --> 20:19.161
the army

20:19.241 --> 20:20.760
may struggle to adapt.

20:21.120 --> 20:22.241
Commander Wang

20:22.520 --> 20:23.760
will also be in a difficult position.

20:25.961 --> 20:27.681
You listed three concerns.

20:29.201 --> 20:30.481
Which one worries you most?

20:30.560 --> 20:31.921
I worry most about you.

20:41.441 --> 20:42.961
I know what you're worried about.

20:43.881 --> 20:45.161
But the more chaotic the situation,

20:45.760 --> 20:46.840
the more opportunities arise.

20:49.961 --> 20:51.360
His Majesty granted me
the courtesy name Huchen.

20:52.481 --> 20:53.800
He expects me

20:54.641 --> 20:55.681
to stir

20:56.441 --> 20:57.481
things up.

20:57.481 --> 20:58.760
Must it be you

20:59.641 --> 21:01.161
to take on the salt reform?

21:03.881 --> 21:05.441
I have already accepted the order.

21:08.401 --> 21:08.881
Then

21:09.401 --> 21:10.320
what if...

21:10.681 --> 21:11.481
what if you

21:11.481 --> 21:12.120
fell ill?

21:12.360 --> 21:13.881
Or if you were attacked?

21:14.800 --> 21:16.481
I took this task on myself.

21:17.481 --> 21:18.721
No one forced it on me.

21:20.320 --> 21:21.681
From the camps of the northwest,

21:22.040 --> 21:23.760
all the way to the imperial study
in the capital.

21:24.681 --> 21:26.001
From a banner commander

21:26.481 --> 21:28.560
to a fourth-rank
Assistant Censor-in-Chief,

21:29.481 --> 21:30.681
it took me only five years.

21:32.721 --> 21:33.760
Everyone says

21:34.360 --> 21:35.441
my official career has been smooth,

21:36.120 --> 21:37.120
almost unstoppable.

21:39.560 --> 21:41.161
But the hardships along the way...

21:48.241 --> 21:49.201
I understand.

21:50.520 --> 21:51.560
That is exactly why

21:52.961 --> 21:54.360
I fear

21:55.120 --> 21:56.401
that you might be consumed
by the flames.

21:57.043 --> 22:01.217
♪A lone rider heads
for the distant frontier♪

22:04.040 --> 22:05.921
But now is not the time to be afraid.

22:07.161 --> 22:08.401
The struggle for power at court

22:09.201 --> 22:10.641
is like rowing against the current.

22:11.280 --> 22:12.401
If you don't move forward,
you fall behind.

22:14.961 --> 22:15.721
Tingyun.

22:17.560 --> 22:19.401
Our opponent is too powerful.

22:22.280 --> 22:23.760
(There's a staircase before me.)

22:25.921 --> 22:27.201
(I have no choice but to keep climbing,)

22:29.360 --> 22:30.280
(all the way to the top.)

22:33.961 --> 22:35.360
(Only by standing high enough)

22:37.681 --> 22:39.560
(can I truly protect us)

22:42.600 --> 22:44.921
(from the storm of arrows
aimed our way.)

22:45.890 --> 22:51.617
♪I lift a cup of humble wine
to the passing breeze♪

22:51.898 --> 22:55.045
♪Looking back,
I see this life as a ballad♪

22:55.080 --> 22:55.881
(Tingyun.)

22:57.320 --> 22:58.641
(Give me a little more time.)

23:00.800 --> 23:02.401
(I want to be the one you can rely on.)

23:10.800 --> 23:12.441
What is ambition?

23:13.401 --> 23:14.921
Ambition is desire.

23:15.481 --> 23:17.001
One can have ambition,

23:17.600 --> 23:18.800
and one can have desire.

23:19.921 --> 23:21.280
But it must be kept in check.

23:24.560 --> 23:25.760
Sometimes,

23:25.840 --> 23:27.360
I do admire

23:29.080 --> 23:30.881
those who climbed up from the bottom.

23:33.120 --> 23:33.800
They have

23:33.800 --> 23:34.921
a certain edge

23:35.120 --> 23:36.241
and a stubborn streak.

23:36.800 --> 23:37.961
But people like that

23:39.800 --> 23:41.401
often share a common flaw.

23:41.520 --> 23:43.441
They never know when to stop.

23:45.280 --> 23:47.401
When a man has been crushed
at the bottom for too long,

23:47.401 --> 23:48.641
he tends

23:51.961 --> 23:52.961
to only know how to advance

23:54.721 --> 23:55.760
and never retreat.

24:01.001 --> 24:02.481
I've set the stage for you.

24:03.280 --> 24:05.080
From here on out, you'll have

24:05.481 --> 24:06.721
plenty of people willing
to do the dirty work.

24:14.800 --> 24:16.040
Greetings, Aunt.

24:16.481 --> 24:17.560
Congratulations, Aunt.

24:18.441 --> 24:19.600
What is the occasion?

24:19.721 --> 24:20.520
In the past,

24:20.600 --> 24:21.560
the Yan merchants,

24:21.560 --> 24:23.120
with their proximity to the northwest,

24:23.320 --> 24:25.040
always got the jump on every deal.

24:25.481 --> 24:26.520
But we Anzhou merchants

24:26.520 --> 24:27.401
are far in the southeast.

24:28.120 --> 24:28.800
But now,

24:29.401 --> 24:30.840
with the salt reform above,

24:31.401 --> 24:32.280
it looks

24:32.280 --> 24:33.760
like the advantage is shifting our way.

24:37.080 --> 24:38.721
You are truly clever.

24:39.120 --> 24:40.681
It's a pity that your mind

24:40.681 --> 24:42.360
isn't focused on the right things.

24:42.360 --> 24:44.401
I've just had several outfits made

24:44.401 --> 24:45.560
and some jewelry crafted.

24:45.721 --> 24:47.040
All you need to study

24:47.040 --> 24:48.161
is how to be more beautiful

24:48.161 --> 24:49.280
and more endearing.

24:49.760 --> 24:51.280
The more radiant you are,

24:51.881 --> 24:53.641
the more I will adore you.

24:58.320 --> 24:59.001
Yes.

25:05.120 --> 25:06.201
Miss Xie, it seems your days

25:06.201 --> 25:07.201
are about to get better.

25:09.641 --> 25:10.760
She never acts without gain.

25:11.840 --> 25:12.800
She has been keeping me

25:13.241 --> 25:15.320
only to find new buyers.

25:17.560 --> 25:18.961
But from what I can see now,

25:20.560 --> 25:22.080
she must have some scheme in mind.

25:22.320 --> 25:23.520
Why not sell?

25:26.881 --> 25:27.520
Move.

25:27.681 --> 25:28.600
The Yan merchants have shut shops.

25:28.600 --> 25:29.840
(Yan)
No salt will be sold in the near future.

25:29.840 --> 25:30.520
Go on, move along.

25:31.201 --> 25:31.881
No salt.

25:31.881 --> 25:32.401
(Sihai Salt Shop)
No salt.

25:32.401 --> 25:33.120
Don't stand here.

25:33.120 --> 25:33.681
Move along.

25:39.040 --> 25:39.881
If this keeps up,

25:39.881 --> 25:41.201
(Yan Merchant Guild)
we'll be stuck with it all.

25:41.320 --> 25:42.641
Mr. Jin.

25:42.641 --> 25:43.401
Mr. Jin.

25:43.401 --> 25:44.161
Mr. Jin is here.

25:44.161 --> 25:44.961
Mr. Jin is here.

25:45.520 --> 25:46.080
Mr. Jin.

26:03.760 --> 26:05.120
Quite impressive, all of you.

26:06.881 --> 26:08.401
Who told you to shut down?

26:09.161 --> 26:09.840
Mr. Jin.

26:10.161 --> 26:12.080
We had no other choice.

26:12.360 --> 26:14.481
Our dynasty's salt law
uses the grain-for-salt system.

26:14.600 --> 26:16.840
We transport grain
to the border garrisons

26:17.001 --> 26:17.840
to exchange for salt permits.

26:17.840 --> 26:19.201
With the permits, we get salt.

26:19.401 --> 26:20.800
We've held our own

26:20.800 --> 26:22.721
against the Anzhou merchants
thanks to our location.

26:22.921 --> 26:24.840
But now that the salt law
has been changed so abruptly,

26:24.921 --> 26:27.280
the grain routes to the border towns
that we've maintained for decades

26:27.441 --> 26:28.840
have all been rendered useless.

26:28.840 --> 26:31.001
Right, all that hard work is wasted.

26:31.001 --> 26:32.201
And closing shop will help?

26:32.201 --> 26:33.120
How many heads do you have?

26:33.241 --> 26:34.441
You dare defy the court?

26:34.441 --> 26:35.800
If you get arrested,

26:35.800 --> 26:36.721
you'll quiet down soon enough.

26:39.201 --> 26:40.641
Then please give us some advice.

26:42.201 --> 26:43.040
I heard

26:43.441 --> 26:45.320
that the salt reform
is being personally overseen

26:45.320 --> 26:47.040
by Mr. Zhao.

26:47.721 --> 26:48.360
Perhaps

26:48.641 --> 26:50.560
we could find a way to reach him?

26:51.040 --> 26:51.600
Yes.

26:51.800 --> 26:52.760
We should find Mr. Zhao.

26:52.760 --> 26:53.800
Please help us.

26:54.201 --> 26:55.401
Please help us.

26:56.760 --> 26:57.520
Mr. Jin.

26:57.681 --> 27:00.481
Everyone on the northwestern routes
knows that you and Mr. Zhao

27:00.721 --> 27:03.161
have been through life and death
together.

27:03.161 --> 27:04.241
Because of that,

27:04.360 --> 27:06.721
we've paid tribute to you
all these years.

27:12.800 --> 27:15.280
Now your connection with Mr. Zhao

27:15.681 --> 27:17.001
is the connection

27:17.001 --> 27:18.401
between all Yan merchants and Mr. Zhao.

27:18.401 --> 27:19.800
Yes.

27:19.881 --> 27:20.520
Mr. Jin.

27:20.681 --> 27:22.320
Given your relationship with Mr. Zhao,

27:22.320 --> 27:23.520
you must have a way.

27:23.641 --> 27:24.760
Please save us Yan merchants.

27:24.760 --> 27:25.681
What are you panicking about?

27:26.120 --> 27:27.120
Did I say I wouldn't help?

27:29.600 --> 27:31.600
See? I told you Mr. Jin had the means.

27:31.600 --> 27:33.201
It has to be Mr. Jin.

27:35.161 --> 27:36.280
The Dragon Boat Festival is near.

27:36.560 --> 27:37.560
I will host

27:37.921 --> 27:39.161
a willow-shooting gathering.

27:40.120 --> 27:41.800
I will set the stage for you.

27:42.441 --> 27:44.120
Thank you, Mr. Jin.

27:44.415 --> 27:45.728
(Invitation)

27:45.760 --> 27:46.600
Willow-shooting?

27:48.201 --> 27:49.441
(Willow-Shooting Gathering)
Jin Yuanbao sent it.

27:50.241 --> 27:51.001
In a few days,

27:53.441 --> 27:55.040
would you like to come with me?

27:57.921 --> 27:59.120
Just to socialize?

28:04.320 --> 28:06.080
Yuanbao has gathered the Yan merchants.

28:06.481 --> 28:07.441
Likely

28:08.241 --> 28:09.881
to pressure you into taking a stand.

28:10.681 --> 28:12.040
This willow-shooting gathering

28:12.040 --> 28:13.641
feels like a trap.

28:15.961 --> 28:16.760
Mr. Zhao.

28:17.241 --> 28:19.401
I don't want to see you
strike your own brother first.

28:20.481 --> 28:21.721
This willow-shooting gathering...

28:23.760 --> 28:25.280
Can I skip it?

28:25.481 --> 28:26.961
But I really need you.

28:30.961 --> 28:32.161
In official circles,

28:32.600 --> 28:34.001
men are bound

28:34.001 --> 28:35.201
to vie with one another.

28:37.201 --> 28:39.520
But someone also needs
to move among the ladies.

28:40.040 --> 28:40.681
In the future,

28:40.800 --> 28:42.800
if there's anything
they can't say to me directly,

28:43.241 --> 28:44.241
at least they'll know

28:45.001 --> 28:46.001
who to send a message through.

28:49.161 --> 28:50.001
Mr. Zhao.

28:51.241 --> 28:52.040
What is it?

28:54.921 --> 28:55.961
Back then,

28:57.161 --> 28:59.360
when I brought you
into the Yongning embezzlement case,

29:00.520 --> 29:02.001
it was the same.

29:03.001 --> 29:04.681
I told you then

29:05.560 --> 29:07.800
that moving among officials' wives

29:08.681 --> 29:10.201
required a proper identity,

29:11.161 --> 29:12.760
a proper husband.

29:13.280 --> 29:14.001
Don't worry.

29:15.120 --> 29:16.320
Things are different now.

29:16.921 --> 29:17.641
Now,

29:19.280 --> 29:21.280
no one can casually decide our fate.

29:22.600 --> 29:23.800
Interest and emotion,

29:24.840 --> 29:25.961
like fire and ice,

29:27.481 --> 29:29.120
cannot coexist without melting.

29:30.681 --> 29:32.681
But who knows how much danger

29:33.641 --> 29:35.320
and how much old affection

29:36.840 --> 29:38.360
it will take to melt the ice?

29:42.600 --> 29:44.401
(Invitation)
Whatever happens with Jin Yuanbao,

29:44.881 --> 29:45.881
what lies between you and me

29:47.360 --> 29:48.641
will never change.

29:55.641 --> 29:56.681
In that case,

29:58.161 --> 29:59.921
we need to find a way to handle this.

30:00.760 --> 30:02.161
But we are new to the capital.

30:02.161 --> 30:03.201
We have no foothold yet.

30:04.241 --> 30:05.800
It may be hard to stand alone.

30:11.721 --> 30:12.560
Grand Secretary Tian.

30:14.201 --> 30:14.840
Grand Secretary.

30:15.840 --> 30:17.360
Commander Zhao, what brings you here?

30:17.360 --> 30:18.921
You are a man
of great virtue and influence.

30:19.280 --> 30:20.800
The willow-shooting gathering
is in a few days.

30:21.280 --> 30:22.320
I have taken the liberty

30:22.961 --> 30:24.760
(Invitation)
to invite you to join the gathering.

30:26.401 --> 30:27.560
I

30:27.721 --> 30:28.520
appreciate

30:28.520 --> 30:29.721
the gesture.

30:30.080 --> 30:31.921
But these old bones

30:31.921 --> 30:33.280
can't take much strain.

30:33.280 --> 30:34.641
Please don't count me in.

30:34.921 --> 30:36.481
I am new to the capital,

30:36.840 --> 30:37.840
yet entrusted with great responsibility.

30:38.840 --> 30:40.080
Without guidance,

30:40.280 --> 30:41.201
I cannot help but feel uneasy.

30:41.641 --> 30:43.360
I intend to petition His Majesty

30:43.840 --> 30:45.241
to invite you to take charge

30:45.840 --> 30:47.080
and oversee the salt reform.

30:47.560 --> 30:48.320
Please, no.

30:48.760 --> 30:52.001
I am due to retire in half a year.

30:52.001 --> 30:53.881
Salt reform takes years.

30:53.881 --> 30:55.441
I won't last that long.

30:55.800 --> 30:56.840
Salt reform is a major undertaking.

30:57.001 --> 30:58.800
Why rush your retirement?

30:59.760 --> 31:00.641
Stay one more term.

31:01.080 --> 31:02.161
If I dare

31:02.520 --> 31:03.721
to petition His Majesty,

31:04.201 --> 31:05.961
I am sure he will consent.

31:08.280 --> 31:09.320
Well...

31:10.120 --> 31:11.600
The willow-shooting gathering.

31:12.080 --> 31:13.360
Let me see.

31:13.360 --> 31:14.280
If that day permits,

31:14.280 --> 31:15.600
I will come.

31:15.760 --> 31:17.040
After court today,

31:17.800 --> 31:19.201
His Majesty kept me

31:19.206 --> 31:20.325
(Willow-Shooting Gathering. Jin Yuanbao)

31:20.520 --> 31:22.161
in the imperial study for a talk.

31:24.120 --> 31:25.241
I will come.

31:34.797 --> 31:35.870
(Willow-Shooting Gathering)

31:35.881 --> 31:36.520
Look.

31:37.280 --> 31:38.280
There are ornamental carp in the pond.

31:38.641 --> 31:39.241
Right.

31:39.320 --> 31:40.280
Let's go closer to see them.

31:42.441 --> 31:43.881
It's been a long time.

31:43.881 --> 31:44.760
Indeed.

31:48.360 --> 31:51.001
Today, was Miss Xie
the only official's wife invited,

31:51.201 --> 31:52.681
(Madam Ye, Yan Merchant)
or were invitations sent to all?

31:52.961 --> 31:53.840
All were sent.

31:53.840 --> 31:55.161
But with the situation unsettled,

31:55.161 --> 31:56.441
aside from Miss Xie,

31:56.600 --> 31:59.001
which official's wife in the capital
would be willing to grace us?

32:00.800 --> 32:02.641
I saw willow-shooting
when I was a child.

32:02.961 --> 32:04.441
It's been years.

32:04.840 --> 32:06.040
Thanks to you all,

32:06.040 --> 32:07.600
I have the chance to see it again.

32:09.280 --> 32:10.161
Consider it

32:10.280 --> 32:11.360
an added pleasure.

32:11.961 --> 32:12.921
So beautiful.

32:14.921 --> 32:17.481
Everyone knows Commander Zhao
is a seasoned warrior,

32:17.481 --> 32:19.040
a marksman who can hit a target
from a hundred paces.

32:19.441 --> 32:20.760
My husband instructed

32:20.881 --> 32:22.681
that to honor Commander Zhao today,

32:22.881 --> 32:24.520
we should shoot live doves from gourds.

32:24.600 --> 32:26.040
It symbolizes double fortune

32:26.040 --> 32:27.760
and rising to great heights.

32:32.320 --> 32:34.040
Good!

32:35.800 --> 32:36.241
This...

32:38.120 --> 32:39.560
Why won't the dove fly?

32:42.201 --> 32:43.881
How did the dove die?

32:45.080 --> 32:46.001
What happened?

32:46.280 --> 32:48.161
We can plan everything perfectly,

32:48.280 --> 32:49.881
but heaven may not cooperate.

32:50.280 --> 32:51.641
Today, the doves

32:51.641 --> 32:52.921
just won't fly.

32:56.360 --> 32:57.520
What are you standing around for?

32:57.760 --> 32:59.040
Get rid of this unlucky thing.

32:59.040 --> 33:00.120
Take it away.

33:03.360 --> 33:04.201
Mr. Jin.

33:04.641 --> 33:05.641
Tell Commander Zhao.

33:06.080 --> 33:08.120
Whether the doves fly today

33:08.120 --> 33:09.360
all depends on

33:09.360 --> 33:11.441
where the salt reform strikes first.

33:12.441 --> 33:13.840
Isn't this chaos enough?

33:17.800 --> 33:18.560
Yuanbao.

33:19.800 --> 33:20.961
This willow-shooting gathering

33:21.721 --> 33:23.080
was organized by you?

33:24.241 --> 33:24.961
Yes.

33:27.921 --> 33:28.481
Mr. Jin.

33:29.401 --> 33:30.760
We've come so far,

33:31.560 --> 33:33.201
and you bring me bad luck here.

33:33.641 --> 33:34.280
Mr. Zhao.

33:34.280 --> 33:34.721
This...

33:34.721 --> 33:35.881
I truly didn't know.

33:35.881 --> 33:37.641
"Didn't know" is all you have to say?

33:38.120 --> 33:39.961
After all the flattery you've heard,

33:40.721 --> 33:42.641
you actually thought
you could handle this?

33:43.921 --> 33:44.681
Remember this.

33:45.600 --> 33:46.840
Once an arrow leaves the string,

33:47.280 --> 33:48.560
there is no turning back.

33:50.840 --> 33:52.481
If anyone is foolish enough

33:53.001 --> 33:55.360
to put obstacles in the arrow's path,

33:56.040 --> 33:57.560
the Ministry of Justice

34:01.360 --> 34:03.201
knows its accounts better than you do.

34:11.881 --> 34:13.680
I invited Grand Secretary Tian today.

34:14.841 --> 34:17.120
If anyone ruins his enjoyment,

34:17.200 --> 34:18.560
has Grand Secretary Tian taken a side?

34:18.640 --> 34:20.200
Think carefully about the consequences.

34:20.921 --> 34:22.560
What does Grand Secretary Tian
have to do with this?

34:23.961 --> 34:25.040
I didn't expect this.

34:25.160 --> 34:26.361
Let's wait and see.

34:26.881 --> 34:28.560
Grand Secretary Tian has arrived.

34:29.921 --> 34:30.401
What is this?

34:30.481 --> 34:31.040
What is this?

34:31.640 --> 34:32.321
Where is he?

34:32.481 --> 34:33.720
Why is there a box?

34:34.080 --> 34:35.160
Grand Secretary Tian learned

34:35.240 --> 34:36.441
that officials and merchants
gathered here today.

34:36.761 --> 34:37.961
He sent this gift

34:37.961 --> 34:38.801
to represent himself.

34:39.361 --> 34:40.640
He sends a cap?

34:40.640 --> 34:41.761
What a peculiar gesture.

34:41.881 --> 34:42.921
Sending a cap?

34:42.921 --> 34:44.481
Does that mean he's here or not?

34:44.481 --> 34:45.841
At best, you could say

34:45.841 --> 34:46.560
he's here in spirit.

34:47.520 --> 34:48.401
Who sent it?

34:48.600 --> 34:49.441
It was Madam Wei.

34:53.240 --> 34:55.841
You can't blame the Tian family
for going back on our word.

34:56.921 --> 34:58.401
You invited my father to be present

34:58.881 --> 35:00.801
to use his official authority.

35:01.001 --> 35:02.481
The cap has arrived.

35:02.881 --> 35:04.321
So has the authority.

35:04.520 --> 35:05.640
That is not a breach of faith.

35:06.361 --> 35:08.361
As for how well things turn out,

35:08.761 --> 35:10.961
that depends entirely
on your own ability.

35:13.761 --> 35:15.200
Grand Secretary Tian's authority

35:15.720 --> 35:16.841
is naturally useful.

35:18.841 --> 35:20.640
But everyone wields it differently.

35:22.120 --> 35:23.761
Many at court often murmur

35:23.761 --> 35:25.520
that Lord Wei's rise

35:25.520 --> 35:27.120
was protected by the Grand Secretary.

35:28.680 --> 35:30.120
But back in Yongning Prefecture,

35:31.120 --> 35:32.080
how did Madam Yu

35:32.080 --> 35:33.680
manage to take that set of Pai Gow

35:33.680 --> 35:35.200
from you?

35:35.801 --> 35:37.441
If Lord Wei ever finds out

35:37.881 --> 35:40.720
that it was you who didn't want
him to rise too quickly.

35:41.680 --> 35:42.200
You...

35:43.560 --> 35:44.520
Please, Madam Wei, do not be angry.

35:44.961 --> 35:46.200
I meant no offense.

35:47.560 --> 35:48.720
It is just that now,

35:49.120 --> 35:50.640
I

35:51.720 --> 35:53.520
need you

35:54.200 --> 35:55.321
to play your part

35:56.240 --> 35:57.401
and help us out of this mess.

36:08.441 --> 36:09.080
Hit!

36:09.080 --> 36:09.761
Hit!

36:10.080 --> 36:10.841
It's a hit!

36:15.160 --> 36:16.160
Madam Wei, if you would,

36:16.720 --> 36:17.921
please be the judge.

36:18.520 --> 36:19.680
How well

36:20.520 --> 36:21.720
did this dove fly?

36:22.801 --> 36:23.200
This...

36:23.600 --> 36:25.361
That's clearly a sparrow.

36:25.361 --> 36:26.040
Exactly.

36:26.361 --> 36:28.120
It doesn't look like a dove at all.

36:28.361 --> 36:30.160
If Commander Zhao says it's a dove,

36:30.680 --> 36:32.040
then it's a dove.

36:32.560 --> 36:33.560
Madam Wei's word

36:33.560 --> 36:35.040
could well be
Grand Secretary Tian's word.

36:35.040 --> 36:36.640
Since Madam Wei said so,

36:37.120 --> 36:38.160
it's a dove.

36:38.640 --> 36:39.281
Yes.

36:39.281 --> 36:40.361
Yes, it's a dove.

36:40.361 --> 36:40.921
A dove.

36:40.921 --> 36:41.361
That's right.

36:41.560 --> 36:42.281
A dove.

36:47.630 --> 36:50.197
(Diequ Pavilion)

36:50.520 --> 36:52.321
Thanks to you, I got to enjoy

36:52.640 --> 36:53.761
a taste

36:53.761 --> 36:55.040
of what it's like to twist the truth.

36:55.801 --> 36:57.600
It is I who should thank you, Madam Wei.

36:58.160 --> 36:59.520
But next time,

36:59.520 --> 37:01.560
think before you act.

37:01.720 --> 37:03.361
My father is old.

37:04.040 --> 37:05.200
He only wishes to retire.

37:05.200 --> 37:06.321
From now on,

37:06.401 --> 37:08.281
leave the Tian family
out of these affairs.

37:09.080 --> 37:11.560
Do you really think the Tian family
is a weather vane,

37:11.720 --> 37:12.841
turning

37:12.961 --> 37:14.080
with the wind?

37:14.761 --> 37:16.001
If there is a next time,

37:16.001 --> 37:17.441
don't count on me again.

37:18.321 --> 37:19.240
I wouldn't dare.

37:19.640 --> 37:20.841
The Tian family stands tall.

37:21.481 --> 37:22.600
I simply follow.

37:24.200 --> 37:25.640
You certainly have a way with words.

37:26.200 --> 37:27.321
Your good looks

37:27.321 --> 37:28.680
are not wasted.

37:30.600 --> 37:32.441
No wonder

37:32.441 --> 37:33.881
the beautiful and talented Miss Xie

37:34.200 --> 37:35.401
would be

37:35.401 --> 37:37.080
so devoted to you.

37:39.481 --> 37:40.361
Thank you, Madam Wei.

37:40.881 --> 37:41.881
I'll take my leave.

38:09.040 --> 38:10.961
Commander Zhao settled everything
with one arrow.

38:11.040 --> 38:12.481
Truly heroic and glorious.

38:12.481 --> 38:14.520
Miss Xie, you're truly fortunate.

38:15.001 --> 38:17.160
- Right.
- Truly fortunate.

38:17.160 --> 38:18.200
Sorry I'm a bit late.

38:18.680 --> 38:19.921
Did I miss anything?

38:21.600 --> 38:23.080
Young Madam Yu, you've graced us.

38:23.160 --> 38:24.001
Please, have a seat.

38:26.680 --> 38:27.680
Good heavens,

38:27.801 --> 38:29.200
the Yu family actually came.

38:29.401 --> 38:30.401
Indeed.

38:30.680 --> 38:31.761
Regarding the salt reform,

38:32.720 --> 38:34.120
the Yan merchants
have no further objections.

38:35.160 --> 38:35.761
Mr. Zhao.

38:36.481 --> 38:37.001
Please.

38:37.441 --> 38:38.441
To Mr. Zhao.

38:42.080 --> 38:44.001
But as for the exact shares,

38:44.841 --> 38:46.401
please clarify, Mr. Zhao.

38:47.401 --> 38:48.441
His Majesty has approved it.

38:50.841 --> 38:51.600
Old permits

38:52.240 --> 38:53.841
can be exchanged for new ones
at seventy percent.

38:54.120 --> 38:55.921
Grain reserves can offset thirty percent
of the silver tax.

38:58.281 --> 38:59.841
Of the Salt Transport Office's
allocation,

39:01.040 --> 39:02.640
the Yan merchants
get thirty percent priority.

39:02.720 --> 39:04.441
- Thirty percent?
- How do we share with that?

39:04.560 --> 39:06.441
- That's too little.
- Yes, exactly.

39:07.001 --> 39:07.841
Mr. Zhao,

39:08.680 --> 39:10.801
isn't thirty percent too little?

39:11.040 --> 39:12.481
Our Yan merchants number over a hundred,

39:12.481 --> 39:14.160
with thousands of workers.

39:14.160 --> 39:16.361
We are driven by survival.

39:16.520 --> 39:17.361
In my view,

39:18.801 --> 39:20.281
it should at least be this much.

39:24.321 --> 39:25.441
The northern and southern merchants

39:25.881 --> 39:26.841
each have their difficulties.

39:27.761 --> 39:28.640
Thirty percent

39:30.240 --> 39:31.761
is already the court's concession.

39:32.761 --> 39:34.200
Otherwise,
how would the Anzhou merchants see it?

39:35.801 --> 39:37.240
Should they shut down too?

39:38.040 --> 39:39.080
Then there would be no order at all.

39:39.401 --> 39:40.921
The Anzhou merchants can't do that.

39:40.921 --> 39:41.281
This...

39:43.720 --> 39:44.361
Alright.

39:44.841 --> 39:46.321
We'll follow your instructions.

39:48.520 --> 39:49.921
If we have not
been gracious hosts today,

39:50.881 --> 39:52.600
please forgive us, Mr. Zhao.

40:00.361 --> 40:00.961
Mr. Zhao.

40:01.321 --> 40:02.680
An Anzhou merchant
insists on seeing you.

40:09.023 --> 40:11.603
(Next Episode)

40:12.281 --> 40:13.401
If in the future

40:13.761 --> 40:15.520
we are to live under the same roof,

40:16.120 --> 40:17.841
I will respect you

40:17.921 --> 40:18.961
and defer to you in all things.

40:19.200 --> 40:20.921
Since you know my past,

40:21.001 --> 40:22.080
you should know

40:22.680 --> 40:23.560
what I am capable of.

40:23.720 --> 40:25.001
Do you truly wish

40:25.160 --> 40:26.240
to contend with me?

40:26.600 --> 40:27.921
The Fu family

40:28.321 --> 40:29.720
places great importance on filial piety.

40:30.401 --> 40:32.321
Shouldn't you show us

40:32.801 --> 40:34.481
some real proof of that?

40:34.961 --> 40:35.921
Mr. Zhao.

40:36.200 --> 40:37.281
Do you truly not understand,

40:37.361 --> 40:38.321
or are you pretending not to?

40:38.841 --> 40:40.200
If you dare disturb my mother,

40:40.200 --> 40:41.120
just try.

40:41.281 --> 40:43.040
You don't have to come see me anymore.

40:43.240 --> 40:45.401
There is no way the two of you
will ever get married.

40:58.960 --> 41:03.280
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

41:06.880 --> 41:11.240
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

41:13.360 --> 41:18.000
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

41:18.240 --> 41:21.040
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

41:22.200 --> 41:26.840
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

41:30.040 --> 41:36.880
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

41:37.760 --> 41:44.280
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:45.240 --> 41:48.680
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:49.200 --> 41:53.400
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:53.680 --> 41:59.360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

42:11.480 --> 42:15.360
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

42:19.280 --> 42:23.280
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

42:25.000 --> 42:29.680
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

42:30.000 --> 42:32.680
♪Kept close within my heart♪

42:33.760 --> 42:38.600
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

42:42.120 --> 42:49.040
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:49.920 --> 42:56.400
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

42:57.280 --> 43:00.800
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

43:01.240 --> 43:05.600
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

43:05.800 --> 43:11.520
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
